{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119937","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119937/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119937/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119937/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119937","id":4562545445,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hVSNJ","number":119937,"title":"Fix AnimationTree: BlendSpace2D \"Add Animation\" context sub-menu does not…","user":{"login":"quhongbin","id":87806179,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3ODA2MTc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87806179?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin","html_url":"https://github.com/quhongbin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quhongbin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-01T11:04:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T08:52:24Z","closed_at":"2026-06-02T08:52:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119937","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119937.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119937.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\ndisable the “Add Animation\" sub-menu when right click in AnimationTree Blender2D. If there are no AnimationPlayer Node.\r\n\r\nrelated to issue : #119801\r\n\r\n## Demo(after fixing)\r\nFixing method refer to the file [animation_state_machine_editor.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/animation/animation_state_machine_editor.cpp#L829-L838)\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\tLocalVector<StringName> animation_names = tree->get_sorted_animation_list();\r\n\tmenu->add_submenu_node_item(TTR(\"Add Animation\"), animations_menu);\r\n\tif (animation_names.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\tmenu->set_item_disabled(menu->get_item_idx_from_text(TTR(\"Add Animation\")), true);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tfor (const StringName &name : animation_names) {\r\n\t\t\tanimations_menu->add_icon_item(theme_cache.animation_icon, name);\r\n\t\t\tanimations_to_add.push_back(name);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\n[godot_issue.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/444a8bf2-cb4c-4773-b8b5-42d5e2067a66)\r\n\r\n## Why does this situation occur?\r\n\r\nIf you are not set the AnimationPlayer Node and have no animations, there are no animations to add when you right click to add animation in AnimationTree BlendSpace2D.\r\n\r\nSummary: No animation libraries stored in AnimationPlayer → empty animation_set → no available animations.\r\n\r\n## AI usage\r\nAI Agent: Hermes\r\nAI Model: DeepSeek-v4-pro\r\n\r\nUsed Hermes and DeepSeek-v4-pro models to analyze why get_sorted_animation_list() returned an empty list. \r\nFixing method was found by Hermes Agent to compare the [animation_state_machine_editor.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/animation/animation_state_machine_editor.cpp#L829-L838)\r\n\r\n\r\n### call-chains(DeepSeek-v4-pro generate the chains , and GPT generate image)\r\n<img width=\"1216\" height=\"1294\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/005d5d75-5b99-427f-8e87-74038a716942\" />\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119937/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119937/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}